  "short_description": "造訪賈巴沃克島的學生們，因為黑白熊的陰謀而被迫進行自相殘殺，不得不展開班級審判以找出犯人。駁倒對方發言中的矛盾，在高速推理動作遊戲中揭穿殺人事件的真相！同步收錄全新故事與原作劇情的雙份體驗！",
  "short_description_en": "While on a school trip to Jabberwock Island, students are ensnared in Monokuma’s deadly game, forced into mutual killing and Class Trials to expose the culprit. Break through contradictions with high-speed detective action. Includes both a brand-new scenario and the enhanced original!",
